    {
      "anchor": "[BIN-OPR2:REQ-002]",
      "body": "The conversion supports positive and negative whole numbers and decimal inputs with up to two\nfractional decimal places. Negative values display a leading minus sign followed by the binary\nmagnitude; fractional results display exactly two binary fractional digits, truncating remaining\nbits. *(S1, S2)*",
